{"sourceUrl":"https://eie.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/6456.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:49.124444+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://eie.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/6456.html","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>一、学生申请</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  欢迎优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读北京交通大学电子信息工程学院硕士、博士研究生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>我校推免生只招收全日制。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（一）申请条件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法； </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2.获得推荐学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  3.学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  4.身心健康，符合规定的体检要求；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  5.申请人获得所在学校推免生资格(如所在学校尚未完成推免资格评定工作，但预计可取得推免生资格者，也可申请)，最终拟录取结果以学生是否具有推免资格及复试成绩等决定。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（二）申请材料</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>有效居民身份证；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2.学信网学籍在线验证报告；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本科成绩单，要求加盖学生所在学校教务处公章；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  4.学术科研成果（公开发表的论文、出版的专著等）、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>全国大学</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>英语四（六）级成绩单、获奖证书等；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>申请直接攻读博士研究生者（直博生）还须提供《直博生个人陈述表》</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>附件</span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、两位申请攻读学位学科领域内的教授（或相当专业技术职称）专家的《直博生专家推荐书》</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>附件</span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。以上申请材料由考生在我校推免预报名系统上传电子版图片，可通过对原件进行扫描或拍照生成，上传电子版为</span><span>pdf或jpg格式，每个附件大小不超过1M。申请人必须保证全部申请材料以及网上报名信息的真实性和准确性。如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，我校将取消申请人推免录取资格，并通报申请人所在学校，责任由申请人自负。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  6.电子信息工程学院接收推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）专业</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>是否接收推荐免试</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>硕士研究生</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>是否接收推荐免试</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>直博生</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>080900</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>电子科学与技术</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>081000</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>信息与通信工程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>0810J1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>低空技术与工程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085401</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>新一代电子信息技术（含量子技术等）（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085402</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>通信工程（含宽带网络、移动通信等）（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>085410</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>人工智能（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（三）申请流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9月8日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>00:00</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>至</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>11</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>23:59</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，申请人登录北京交通大学研究生院招生专题网的</span><span>“推免预报名系统”系统（网址：https://gsadmission.bjtu.edu.cn/recommend/signin/）进行预报名，按系统要求填写报名信息并上传申请材料，每个申请人只能填报一个志愿。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9月11日前，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>申请人</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>需联系</span></span></span><span><span><span>意向研究所导师</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>联系方式详见下文</span><span>“复试”部分。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9月21</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日，申请人（含已通过我校推免预报名复试的申请人）须登录教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/）进行网上报名。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”预计</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9月2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span><span>9：00开通，如开通时间有变化，以最终实际开通时间为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>二</span></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><span>、复试</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>综合面试按复试小组进行，</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9月11日前，申请人需与意向导师联系。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  考生可登录电子信息工程学院主页查看导师名单，网址：</span></span></span></span> </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>       https://eie.bjtu.edu.cn/faculty_l.html</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  考生也可登录研究生院主页</span><span>-导师在线查看导师具体信息，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>导师在线网址：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>       https://aa.bjtu.edu.cn/discipline/tutor_show/?college=01</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9月12日-</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9月19日，复试小组</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>通过邮件、电话、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>短信</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>等途径</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>发出复试通知，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复试具体时间、方式等信息也由复试小组告知。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学校的</span><span>“推免预报名系统”我院仅用于前期复试信息采集，学院不会在复试前通过该系统发放复试通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  3.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9月12日-</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9月19日，各复试小组分批次组织复试。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  复试小组负责确定参加复试的考生名单、考生面试和实践能力考核的具体内容、评分标准、程序，并具体组织实施。考核一般为面试形式，满分为</span><span>100分。考核内容包括外语能力测试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>20分</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、专业及综合能力测试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>80分</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>两部分。复试过程须本着公开公正的原则进行。复试小组对考生现场独立评分</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>，原则上考生须到现场复试。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  4.参加复试的申请人通过我校“推免缴费系统”交纳复试费(100元/人)，缴费网址：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  https://gsadmission.bjtu.edu.cn/recommend/signin_new/。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>三</span></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><span>、录取</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span>复试小组将有意向接收并考核合格的申请人及其拟录取导师报送学院招生工作领导小组集中审核。</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学院将坚持公平公正的原则，在全面考查、综合评价的基础上，根据招生计划，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>分批</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>择优录取推免生。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2.同一专业考生如果复试成绩相同，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>优先录取次序依次为：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>专业及综合能力测试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩、全国大学英语四级考试成绩。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>如果考生</span></span></span><span><span><span>复试</span></span></span><span><span><span>成绩相同，优先录取</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>专业及综合能力测试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩较高的考生。如果</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>专业及综合能力测试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>外语能力测试</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩均相同，优先录取全国大学英语四级考试成绩较高的考生。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>拟录取的推免生须按照要求，在规定时间内登录教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”（网址https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm），完成注册、填写个人基本信息、上传照片、网上支付、填写志愿、确认</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>复试、确认</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>待录取等步骤，网报专业须与拟录取专业一致。未在规定时间内完成确认的推免生，原则上学院将不再保留其拟录取资格，学院可依次递补拟录取其他考生。该系统志愿填报等步骤一般应于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9月21日（教育部推免服务系统开通当日）完成，学院在该系统的拟录取步骤一般于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9月24日进行，如有其它时间安排，将另行通知。未通过该系统确认的推免录取结果，一律无效。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>推免生一旦在教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”接受待录取通知，则不可再接受其它志愿的待录取通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>拟录取的推免生不得再报名参加当年硕士研究生考试招生，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>四</span></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><span>、信息公示与监督联系</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  学院网址：</span><span>https://eie.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/?cat=109</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  招生咨询邮箱：</span><span>dx</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>yjs</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>zs</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>@bjtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  招生咨询电话：</span><span>010-5168</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3683</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  附件</span><span>1：直博生个人陈述表</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  附件</span><span>2：直博生专家推荐书</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>                                                            电子信息工程学院</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>                                                <span>20</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6年9月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p>\n<div>\n<h4>附件：</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://eie.bjtu.edu.cn/media/attachments/2026/09/20260907164009_439.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：直博生个人陈述表.doc</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://eie.bjtu.edu.cn/media/attachments/2026/09/20260907164009_620.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：直博生专家推荐书.doc</a>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"5f9d70da660954111e2465a024957553c19d537c464c966938e7604f6c568daf","textLength":2474,"sourceSha256":"740e1fe1040271fea9f7719d2b8c024e7d756429a7395fcdaf325089c2299f13","selector":"article-like:right_content_cont","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-bb5d645d2959d55d0728","title":"2026年北京交通大学电子信息工程学院2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:49.124444+00:00"}
